v class="review-card"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>"Clean checkout and genuine key."</p><div class="who"><span>Verified buyer</span></div></div></div></div><p class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin-top:10px">Preview: review cards are placeholders; production will load real verified reviews.</p></div>'''
